ion gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}+2\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x}-3{e}^{\\lambda x} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda x}({\\lambda }^{2}+2\\lambda -3) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n{\\lambda }^{2}+2\\lambda -3=0.\n$$\n\nFactoring the auxiliary equation results in\n\n$$\n(\\lambda +3)(\\lambda -1)=0,\n$$\n\nand so $\\lambda =-3$ or $\\lambda =1.$ \n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation is\n\n$$\ny=A{e}^{-3x}+B{e}^{x}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186357469 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "02c53b0e-6d9a-5a83-bf41-08b1929f0bd4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=A{e}^{-5x}+B{e}^{-3x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186354680} {:answer/id #uuid "23c04ba8-e203-5d92-877b-743ffcdc9045" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=A{e}^{2x}+B{e}^{6x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186354965} {:answer/id #uuid "3eea3753-cfa7-5409-b31b-24702ddd6273" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=A{e}^{3x}+B{e}^{5x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186355226} {:answer/id #uuid "cbbf221d-7c59-5836-9798-f17cb8bd6ef9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=A{e}^{x}+B{e}^{7x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186356442} {:answer/id #uuid "cd476d30-432c-55a6-af5a-4916bdf18b29" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=A{e}^{-6x}+B{e}^{2x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186356460}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3eea3753-cfa7-5409-b31b-24702ddd6273" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y=A{e}^{3x}+B{e}^{5x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186355226} :answer-field/id #uuid "9f890261-7007-5f0d-a351-2babd22ea3f6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :